&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Patient Health Companion&lt;/strong&gt; organization, a key initiative helping Doctolib become a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;daily health companion&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;90M people across Europe&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling everyone to manage their health and wellbeing &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;proactively&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll oversee 4 engineering teams and their managers, including our flagship &lt;a class=&quot;break-all font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://www.doctolib.fr/sante/soccuper-de-votre-enfant-a-deux/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Health Companion for Parents of young children&lt;/a&gt;, built within the &lt;a class=&quot;break-all font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://apps.apple.com/app/id925339063&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Doctolib app&lt;/a&gt;, which helps parents manage their children&#39;s appointments, documents, and health journey together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;VP of Engineering, Health Companion&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll work closely with &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Medical Excellence (MedEx), Product, Design, and healthcare professionals&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll join a high-density organization that Doctolib continues to build, bringing together experienced talent across engineering, product, design, and medical expertise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your teams will work across:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;An excellent experience for our AI-powered chat, combining medical expertise with artificial intelligence and built around high standards of medical accuracy and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Personalized recommendation systems that deliver relevant health content, guidance, and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Engaging mobile experiences that make health management intuitive and accessible, including the native mobile foundations described in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;break-all font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://medium.com/doctolib/rebuilding-the-doctolib-homepage-from-webview-to-native-27937ea71801&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Rebuilding the Doctolib homepage from WebView to native&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
