&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience with backend programming languages (e.g. Go, Python, Ruby)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience driving cultural and technical transformations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciate working in regulated environments (healthcare, fintech, or similar); at Doctolib, data privacy and compliance are part of every engineering decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
