&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior Machine Learning Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;AI Health Assistant&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to ensure our AI Health Companion behaves safely, reliably, and helpfully — for millions of patients and practitioners. You will work in a cross-functional team building robust evaluation pipelines for agentic AI systems, contributing directly to improving the quality and safety of AI-powered healthcare.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
