&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Senior Medical Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Medical Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; team&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we&#39;re setting a new pulse for healthcare. We create AI-powered solutions that help health professionals deliver better care, and help people be healthier. As a Medical Lead, you&#39;ll play a critical role in delivering medical innovations with direct public health impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Medical Officer, you will be responsible for the scientific and medical quality and delivery of our patient generalist health companion, particularly its AI Health Assistant. Working hand in hand with product and tech teams, you&#39;ll ensure we build medically robust software products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being accountable for the medical quality of the product and ensuring we build the best solutions from a scientific and medical standpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving medical value and risk assessments to ensure the development of qualitative, safe, and reliable products, and reviewing related specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and validating medical features to ensure accuracy and quality, including AI model performance evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining medical features and content up to date to provide health professionals with accurate and current medical information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in the definition and implementation of the medical knowledge strategy for your product scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting scientific and medical bibliography to ensure all content and products rely on trusted sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
