&lt;p&gt;You could be our next team mate if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3-5 years of clinical experience as a medical doctor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an expert in statistics and epidemiology, and thrive with numbers and analytical work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have previous experience in healthtech and software development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are structured, detail-oriented, and have a strong analytical mindset with excellent project management and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in German or Italian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a double engineer/medical doctor background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a PhD in statistics or epidemiology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
