&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
