&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior or Staff AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Remote Care&lt;/strong&gt; stream at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build AI-powered tools that transform how healthcare professionals deliver care beyond in-person encounters — from intelligent patient messaging to telehealth experiences. You will work in a feature team developing agentic systems across the Patient Messaging platform and Telehealth software, contributing directly to reducing care team workload and improving patient access to continuous care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, ship, and operate production-grade agentic systems powering Remote Care stream products, with strong observability, fallback mechanisms, and fail-safe behaviors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve AI agents, orchestration systems, and core agentic capabilities including memory, reasoning, tool adapters, and multi-agent coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Machine Learning Engineers to design and implement evaluation pipelines, security/safety guardrails, and metrics — taking ownership of operational AI projects as data science teams focus on exploratory research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own performance, observability, and security: monitoring dashboards, SLO/SLI definition, and security posture, with a particular focus on medical data sensitivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to full-stack development when needed to deliver end-to-end features for healthcare professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and enable software engineers to build confidently in an agentic AI world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 4+ years of experience as a software engineer, with hands-on experience in AI/ML systems, including going through the full lifecycle of an AI product from evaluation and launch to production iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 2+ years of experience working with Python and are comfortable with AI/ML engineering practices including automated testing, CI/CD, and DevOps (&quot;you build it — you run it&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable with full-stack development and not afraid to dive into React/TypeScript or Kotlin to ship end-to-end features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are product-oriented and comfortable guiding your teammates to suggest trade-offs that balance business needs with technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in English in your day-to-day work with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building multi-agent systems or working with agent development frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on AI products for enterprise or professional users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in the medical domain, healthcare tech, or regulated AI-based SaMD (Software as Medical Device)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We also invest in open, applied AI research. For example, our &lt;strong&gt;DoctoBERT&lt;/strong&gt; project introduces open-source medical language models trained for French clinical text, with applications in named entity recognition, classification, and retrieval.&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/blog/hugging-science/doctobert-cookbook#introduction&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Read the DoctoBERT practical guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to learn more about how we bring deep AI research into practical healthcare applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplementary health insurance, with the option to include family members in your household&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership for retirement funds with Ciao Elsa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electronic meal vouchers (8.00€ per worked day), Foorban fridges, and office breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
