&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben, unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Um Chancengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in Deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen. Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte &lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;hier&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di un/una &lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt; che entri a far parte del nostro &lt;strong&gt;team SEO di Milano&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come &lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai un ruolo chiave nella trasformazione e nell&#39;ottimizzazione del nostro marketplace e dei nostri contenuti per milioni di pazienti in Italia. La tua missione sarà supportare la crescita del traffico del dominio&lt;a href=&quot;http://doctolib.it/&quot;&gt; doctolib.it&lt;/a&gt;: analizzerai e metterai in discussione lo status quo del dominio dal punto di vista dei contenuti, tecnico e strategico, individuando e implementando soluzioni innovative con il supporto del nostro framework di AI. È un&#39;opportunità unica per sviluppare le tue competenze in ambito SEO tecnica e di contenuto, project management e AI — il tutto in un ambiente dinamico e guidato da una missione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib opera in mercati dinamici e competitivi. Contribuiamo alla digitalizzazione dei sistemi sanitari, migliorando l&#39;accessibilità alle cure e semplificando la vita professionale dei medici in Francia, Germania e Italia. Come parte del nostro team SEO, avrai un ruolo cruciale nel rendere le informazioni sanitarie di alta qualità più visibili e accessibili ai pazienti in tutta Italia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come SEO &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt;, ci supporterai su:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Content SEO&lt;/strong&gt;: contribuirai alle attività di SEO tecnica (audit di crawlability, indicizzazione, Core Web Vitals, rendering) per rendere il nostro dominio sempre più accessibile a crawler e utenti, e allo sviluppo di strategie di contenuto che valorizzino i nostri punti di forza, con l&#39;obiettivo di attrarre traffico qualificato e trasformarlo in conversioni concrete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keyword research e ottimizzazione on-page&lt;/strong&gt;: ti occuperai della ricerca di parole chiave e dell&#39;ottimizzazione di meta tag, title, heading, UX e struttura dei contenuti in ottica SEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborazione cross-funzionale&lt;/strong&gt;: lavorerai a stretto contatto con il team di Marketing B2C italiano per garantire che le caratteristiche e i vantaggi del nostro servizio siano comunicati in modo chiaro e che la portata del traffico delle strategie cross-channel sia massimizzata.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analisi dei dati e reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: monitorerai le performance SEO utilizzando strumenti come Google Search Console, Semrush e altri — contribuendo alla creazione di report periodici sull&#39;andamento del traffico organico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analisi di mercato e benchmarking competitivo&lt;/strong&gt;: analizzerai il posizionamento dei competitor e le tendenze di mercato per individuare nuove opportunità di crescita.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI e apprendimento continuo&lt;/strong&gt;: ti terrai aggiornato/a sulle novità dei motori di ricerca e sugli aggiornamenti degli algoritmi, con un focus particolare sull&#39;utilizzo di strumenti di AI generativa come Claude a supporto delle attività SEO (analisi dei dati, generazione e ottimizzazione dei contenuti, automazione di attività ripetitive), proponendo soluzioni innovative da testare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cosa ci aspettiamo da te&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prima di continuare a leggere, se il profilo descritto non è perfettamente aderente al tuo attuale profilo professionale ma ritieni che questa descrizione corrisponda alle tue capacità e alle tue esigenze, ti invitiamo a proseguire!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Questo ruolo potrebbe fare per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;parli italiano a livello madrelingua e inglese fluente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hai familiarità con un CMS come WordPress;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hai familiarità con strumenti di AI come Gemini, Claude o ChatGPT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;dimostri una forte attenzione ai dettagli e senso di ownership sui tuoi flussi di lavoro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sarebbe fantastico se:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hai studiato o maturato esperienza in marketing e comunicazione, giornalismo, lettere, ambito editoriale o publishing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sei appassionato/a o hai esperienza pregressa nel settore healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cosa offriamo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage di 6 mesi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rimborso spese (€1000 lordi al mese)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rimborso abbonamento ATM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Una policy di lavoro flessibile: modalità ibrida (3 giorni in ufficio, 2 da remoto)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buoni pasto (8,00€/giorno lavorato)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formazione continua&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunità di mobilità interna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing e sport: palestra in ufficio con 3 corsi a settimana e servizi in partnership con Wellhub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partecipazione agli eventi aziendali e di team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colazione in ufficio a Milano!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il processo di selezione&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colloquio con il team di Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colloquio finale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offerta!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Descrizione della posizione&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sede: Milano&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data di inizio: Ottobre 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In Doctolib, ci impegniamo a migliorare l&#39;accesso all&#39;assistenza sanitaria per tutte le persone. Questo si riflette nel nostro processo di selezione. Valutiamo i profili esclusivamente in base alle loro qualifiche e alla loro motivazione, senza nessuna forma di discriminazione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Più si ascolteranno idee diverse, più il nostro prodotto migliorerà veramente l&#39;assistenza sanitaria di ogni utente. Quindi ti diamo il benvenuto e ti invitiamo a candidarti per Doctolib, indipendentemente dal tuo genere, religione, età, orientamento sessuale, etnia o disabilità. Unisciti a noi per costruire un mondo più in salute!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Per garantire pari opportunità, ti invitiamo a escludere informazioni personali (ad esempio foto, età) dalle tue candidature. Se hai bisogno di adattamenti particolari per quanto riguarda il processo di selezione, ti preghiamo di informarci quanto prima.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Tutte le informazioni fornite vengono trattate da Doctolib per la gestione delle candidature. Per i dettagli sul trattamento dei dati, clicca&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/v1664533117/legal/Privacy-policy-Site_Career-Septembre-22-IT.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; qui&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Ti preghiamo di contattare &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;hr.dataprivacy(AT)doctolib.com &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;per domande o per esercitare i tuoi diritti.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;SEO team in Milan&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in transforming and optimizing our marketplace and content for millions of patients in Italy. Your mission will be to support&lt;a href=&quot;http://doctolib.it/&quot;&gt; doctolib.it&lt;/a&gt; domain traffic growth: you will analyze and challenge the content, technical and strategic domain status quo, finding and implementing innovative solutions with the support of our AI framework. This is a unique opportunity to develop your skills in content and technical SEO, project management, and AI — all within a mission-driven and dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib operates in dynamic and competitive markets. We contribute to the digitalization of healthcare systems, improving accessibility to care and simplifying practitioners&#39; work-life across France, Germany and Italy. As part of our SEO team, you will play a crucial role in making high-quality health information more visible and accessible to patients across Italy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a SEO Intern&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support us on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll contribute to tech SEO activities (crawlability audits, indexing, Core Web Vitals, rendering) to make our domain increasingly accessible to crawlers and users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content SEO&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll help develop content strategies that leverage our strengths, aiming to attract qualified traffic and turn it into concrete conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keyword research and on-page optimization&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll handle keyword research and optimize meta tags, titles, headings, UX and content structure from an SEO perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll work closely with the Italian B2C Marketing team to ensure the features and benefits of our service are communicated clearly, and that cross-channel strategies&#39; traffic reach is maximized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data analysis and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll monitor SEO performance using tools like Google Search Console, Semrush, and more — contributing to the creation of periodic reports on organic traffic trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market analysis and competitive benchmarking&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll analyze competitor positioning and market trends to identify new growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and continuous learning&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;ll stay up to date on search engine news and algorithm updates, with a particular focus on using generative AI tools like Claude to support SEO activities (data analysis, content generation and optimization, automating repetitive tasks), proposing innovative solutions to test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on — if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be our next teammate if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you speak native-level Italian and fluent English;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have familiarity with a CMS such as WordPress;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have familiarity with AI tools such as Gemini, Claude, or ChatGPT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you showcase strong attention to detail and ownership over your own work streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;have studied or gained previous experience in marketing &amp;amp; communications, journalism, literature, editorial work, or publishing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;are passionate about or have previous experience in the healthcare industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A detailed, structured and individual onboarding program within our &lt;strong&gt;Doctolib Academy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reimbursement of public transportation (ATM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electronic &lt;strong&gt;meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt; (€8.00 per worked day), Foorban fridges and &lt;strong&gt;office breakfast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace policy&lt;/strong&gt; offering up to &lt;strong&gt;2 days of hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt; per week&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular team building workshops and other company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A partnership with &lt;strong&gt;Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as &lt;strong&gt;free access to the gym in our Milan office&lt;/strong&gt;, with 3 classes offered per week (yoga, pilates, functional training)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner &lt;strong&gt;Moka.care&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with your Talent Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with your future manager onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract Type: Internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working Time: Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 6 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Milan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expected start date: October 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: €1,000/month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This commitment is reflected in our hiring process, where we assess applications based solely on qualifications, potential, and motivation, without discrimination of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that diverse perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences help us build better healthcare products. We welcome applications from all candidates, regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To support equal opportunities, we encourage candidates not to include unnecessary personal information, such as a photo or age, in their application. If you need any accommodation during the hiring process, please let us know and we will do our best to support you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Fullstack Software Engineer to join the PAX (Patient App Experience) team&lt;/strong&gt;, working at the heart of Doctolib’s patient experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team builds and evolves key patient-facing features&lt;/strong&gt;, including appointment search, practitioner profile pages, and notifications. With more than 410K practitioner profiles in France, 90M patient visits, over 17M appointments booked every month, and more than 6M notifications sent every day, you will work on products with massive user impact and demanding performance challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to modernizing legacy code dating back to Doctolib’s early days, while addressing critical SEO challenges that help attract more patients. You will also use generative AI tools, such as Claude Code, to boost your productivity and build high-quality products, following industry best practices and writing clean, maintainable, and scalable code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and engineers to build features that deliver value to healthcare professionals and patients&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement technical solutions ensuring performance, security, and usability across our fullstack applications (React, TypeScript, JVM ecosystem)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to code quality through reviews, testing, and continuous improvement of our development practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share your expertise and collaborate across teams to evolve Doctolib&#39;s architecture and technical standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on — if you don&#39;t meet the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have fullstack software engineering experience with React and the JVM ecosystem (Java, Kotlin, Spring Boot) - Ruby experience is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &quot;user first&quot; mindset and are committed to building secure, well-tested, and pragmatic code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a strong testing culture and are passionate about code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive, curious, and eager to share knowledge through pair programming and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free health insurance for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Care Program: receive one additional month of leave on top of the legal parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Council subsidy to refund part of sport club membership or creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidy to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch voucher with Swile card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of public transportation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support for international mobilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard interview process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total Cash Compensation: min 53K - max 70K&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We show the full range for transparency, so you can see how your compensation evolves as you grow with us. The max isn&#39;t the entry point, it&#39;s the destination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your starting positioning depends on role fit, demonstrated proficiency, and ability to deliver at the required scope. The first half of the pay range is for candidates building proficiency in the role&#39;s scope, while the second half is where you grow into over time, as your impact, skills, and scope deepen within Doctolib.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
