&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop custom monitoring solution&lt;/strong&gt;s including online metrics pipelines and dashboards (Amplitude, Metabase, Tableau) to track AI system performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with the Data Platform teams to &lt;strong&gt;optimize infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, ensure scalability, and manage costs effectively&lt;/p&gt;
