&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Tech &amp;amp; Product Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, your mission will be to help deliver a positive candidate and interviewer experience, coordinate complex interviews, and contribute to the improvement of our recruiting processes. This role is a great opportunity to develop your expertise in talent acquisition while applying your organisational, communication, and project management skills in a fast-paced, high-volume environment. You will work closely with recruiters, interviewers, candidates, and hiring teams as part of our global Talent Acquisition organisation across France, Germany, Italy, and the Netherlands.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Candidate and interviewer experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prepare and send clear, timely communications, including emails, messages, and calendar invitations. Act as a reliable point of contact for candidates and interviewers throughout the recruitment process, including welcoming candidates and supporting their onsite experience when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Interview coordination:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Organise interviews for technical and product roles, from online one-to-one interviews and technical assessments to case studies, panel interviews, and onsite interviews. Coordinate with multiple stakeholders across different time zones and ensure that all participants have the information they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Recruiting process improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contribute ideas and improvements to our interview processes. Help adapt scheduling workflows to meet candidate and business needs, and take ownership of smaller projects that improve the efficiency and quality of our recruitment operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Recruitment operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Support the maintenance of interviewer pools, taking availability, expertise, and diversity into account. Contribute to interviewer training and resources that help create consistent and effective interview experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Tools and documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Support the adoption of recruitment and scheduling tools, including speech-to-text solutions, to improve efficiency and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Data and reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Track scheduling and interview metrics such as time to schedule, time to interview, interview volumes, and declines. Help maintain accurate ATS data and prepare regular reports that support informed decisions about our recruiting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
